flowchart LR
    Human[Human operator] -->|password + MFA| Web[Web app]
    Web -->|15 minute JWT| API[Control-plane API]
    API -->|live user RBAC| Policy[Server permission checks]
    Policy --> Operations[Server operations]
    Operations -->|shared node bearer token| Worker[Host worker agent]
    External[External automation / AI agent] -. no supported credential .-> API
    External -. tempting but overprivileged shortcut .->|shared node token| Worker

